  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Community Livelihoods, Environment &amp; Forests</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The desired impact of the project is Improved livelihoods and overall wellbeing of forest communities in Central Africa, while preserving the ecological integrity of the Congo Basin rainforest. The centrepiece of the project is to support the implementation of the local community forest concession management model (Concessions Foresti&#xe8;res des Communaut&#xe9;s Locales (CFCL) in French) in the Democratic Republic of Congo (DRC), offering a new development pathway that combines securing land- and tenure rights and sustainable development</narrative>
  </description>
